<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia ACP year net up 22 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia ACP year net up 22 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>		     (In million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 33.19	 vs	  27.25</p>
<p>    Shr	    (cents)   83.0	  vs	  68.0</p>
<p>    Dividend     (percent)  4.0	  vs	   8.0</p>
<p>    Turnover		  340.91	 vs	 253.09</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   54.25	 vs	  37.27</p>
<p>    Minorities    less	7.20	 vs  less   1.32</p>
<p>NOTE - ACP Industries Bhd manufactures and distributes construction related products</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
